Cell["\<\
InfraPolygonQ[graph, poly] tests whether poly is a closed chain of geodesic \
InfraSegment sides (every leg a geodesic, consecutive legs sharing endpoints \
cyclically). Accepts an InfraPolygon wrapper or a bare leg list {seg1, ..., \
segn}.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"52225149-d1b2-4a7e-a7a3-e05ef5279ebe"],

